[2026-03-11 17:28:34.087] [INFO ] [http-nio-8881-exec-3] jdbc.sqltiming - SELECT
            B.BOARD_ID,
            B.TITLE,
            B.CONTENT,
            M.USER_ID,
            M.USER_NAME,
